  "conclusion": "A call-time process.env[name] read in a Convex UDF is a synchronous point lookup recorded in its transaction read set. The env edit writes the same system row. Therefore fence-aware admission mutations reading an old value must commit before the edit or be retried after it. This source proof does not replace the live deployment and drained-run census receipt."
